 all the AWS resources that you want (like Amazon EC2 instances or Amazon R=
DS DB instances), and CloudFormation takes care of provisioning and configu=
ring those resources for you.
Generally speaking, it gives developers and systems administrators an easy =
way to create and manage a collection of related AWS resources.</p>
